== Notes ==
* {{dlc|a}} This trinket can be found by destroying {{E|Special Shopkeeper|n}}s.
* {{dlc|a}} This trinket is very useful in [[Greed mode]], as the coins dropped for completing a wave now provide health.
* {{dlc|a+}} Makes the {{E|Ultra Greedier|n}} fight trivial, as many of his attacks drop coins, thus providing free health.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|IV Bag}}: Can chain to create a large amount of coins.
* {{C|Keeper}}: The trinket can be seen as a "better" version of {{t|Rotten Penny}}, as instead of spawning one fly per coin, it spawns multiple at the cost of it being chance-based.
** {{C|Tainted Keeper}}: Fly production is heavily increased as most enemies drop coins on death.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Increases the chances to:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.5<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
